OL,3,GNEWSA'You never quite know what you're
OL,4,Agoing to pull out'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA voluntary clean-up group is marking a
OL,7,Fdecade of finding unusual items in
OL,8,FBristol Harbour, ranging from an
OL,9,Finflatable doll to a Nintendo Switch.
OL,11,FClean Up Bristol Harbour was launched
OL,12,Fin September 2016 in a bid to remove
OL,13,Fplastic pollution from in and around
OL,14,FBristol's waterways.
OL,16,FThe group has fished out some unusual
OL,17,Fitems from the harbour in the past 10
OL,18,Fyears, including a message in a bottle
OL,19,Fcontaining a note in Spanish, a kettle,
OL,20,Ftennis balls, glasses and single shoes
OL,21,Fas well as the inflatable doll and
OL,22,FNintendo Switch.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
